    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27936" root="عتب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَتَّابٌ</span></b>  One <i>who reproves, blames,</i> or <i>censures,
much,</i> or <i>frequently,</i> [<i>in an absolute sense,</i> (see 1,)
or] <i>in anger,</i> or <i>displeasure.</i> (Msb.) [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِتْبٌ</span>.] ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّ عَتَّابٍ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِتْبَانٌ</span>.

